<Layout title="About — SoftStack" description="SoftStack — handpicked free, legit, and genuinely useful GUI apps.">
  <div class="page-container">
  <nav class="breadcrumb">
    <a href="/">Home</a> <span>/</span>
    About
  </nav>

  <article style="max-width:var(--content);margin:0 auto">
    <h1>About SoftStack</h1>
    <p><strong>Curated with care, shared with love.</strong> SoftStack is a handpicked collection of <strong>free, legit, and genuinely useful GUI apps</strong>. Every tool has been tested and vouched for. No pay-to-play listings, no sponsored posts — just great apps that deserve to be found.</p>

    <h2>Why This Exists</h2>
    <p>Software discovery is broken. App stores optimize for revenue, not quality. Search results are dominated by SEO spam and affiliate listicles. The best tools are often the ones with the smallest marketing budgets. SoftStack is an attempt to fix that, one recommendation at a time.</p>

    <h2>Our Philosophy</h2>
    <p>We follow the spirit of the <a href="https://github.com/sindresorhus/awesome/blob/main/awesome.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener">awesome manifesto</a>:</p>
    <ul style="margin:var(--gap) 0;padding-left:1.5rem">
      <li style="margin-bottom:0.5rem"><strong>Curation, not collection.</strong> A shorter list of genuinely great tools beats a comprehensive dump of everything that exists.</li>
      <li style="margin-bottom:0.5rem"><strong>Only awesome is awesome.</strong> Every entry is personally vetted. If we can't vouch for it, it doesn't make the cut.</li>
      <li style="margin-bottom:0.5rem"><strong>Comment on why.</strong> Each listing explains what makes the tool special — not just what it does.</li>
      <li style="margin-bottom:0.5rem"><strong>Free, legit, useful.</strong> We only recommend tools that are free to use, legally obtained, and genuinely solve problems.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Selection Criteria</h2>
    <ul style="margin:var(--gap) 0;padding-left:1.5rem">
      <li style="margin-bottom:0.5rem"><strong>GUI apps only</strong> — this is a site about apps with a graphical interface, not CLI tools</li>
      <li style="margin-bottom:0.5rem"><strong>Free to use</strong> — completely free, open source, or with a genuinely useful free tier</li>
      <li style="margin-bottom:0.5rem"><strong>Legit & legal</strong> — no pirated, cracked, or shady tools</li>
      <li style="margin-bottom:0.5rem"><strong>Hands-on tested</strong> — we don't list anything we haven't used ourselves</li>
      <li style="margin-bottom:0.5rem"><strong>Actively maintained</strong> — not abandonware, not in maintenance mode</li>
      <li style="margin-bottom:0.5rem"><strong>Respects the user</strong> — no dark patterns, no bundling, transparent privacy</li>
    </ul>
  </article>
  </div>
</Layout>
